<title>Sudan's civil war: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/sudan/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-sudan-2026-11-26T12:56:39.717Z</guid>
<pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 12:56:39 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Drone strikes hit a United Nations building and residential areas in Khartoum, killing four people and threatening humanitarian operations, while RSF forces assaulted aid offices in Nyala and a shelter in West Kordofan, causing civilian casualties. RSF counterintelligence chief, a commander and a group defected to the Sudanese army in Khartoum, indicating shifting loyalties. RSF-aligned forces intensified drone attacks in Blue Nile state, killing 19 civilians and displacing thousands as they approached Ed Damazin. Ethiopia offered to host inclusive Sudan peace talks and propose a national unity government, but Sudan rejected the offer, questioning Ethiopia's neutrality, and the conflict produced 4,680 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/nov/26/lana-nusseibeh-uae-sudan-un-secretary-general&quot;&gt;The Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMisgFBVV95cUxQRnpfNzZZUGVhWjh1NGFCdDJQaTlGTl9RUWdXUHFPcFg4MmNObW9PREtfaGQ3R2lrN2Q1c3RySkc0SUJOSlNVMjNZS3JRWXQ2aE1EM25ZMmlKSVBzWUE2NnBEZW1xMW51QzdzZXRpTVdvX2lkMmJRaDBVUGYxWFN4NFJEMnVZT00wYlhXTnJNRWtDWGZiRm9TSURKa0JFejN3UUhKUEpzd3JWSlY3VVBSN1Nn?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian Nigeria News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Facebook&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMijwFBVV95cUxPNjRadDRuVno1ZmxRVGplUkNoYm9lWl82OUhPWnNBUXZRNDgwcFZLbEc1QUFxTzNaQk5NQ2k1VGxSTjFCV3VFTnJJSXl3OVNpU2V3aU1nRFQ2OWxEYUlkMVl6OXgyNVE5bkl3MVJETThBUEdGZTc3LU9DWndEQ2Z0SWtWby0zSEszS0U3TlRKWQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;National Security News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiU0F